# Accepted risks — student project, documented reasons
# Review before production use. Expiry: 2027-01-31

# AWS-0104: Security group egress unrestricted (0.0.0.0/0)
# Reason: k3s single-node cluster requires unrestricted outbound to pull
#         container images from GHCR/Docker Hub and download packages.
#         Restricting egress by CIDR is impractical for a public registry.
AVD-AWS-0104

# AWS-0107: SSH ingress open to 0.0.0.0/0
# Reason: Academic environment with dynamic IPs — students connect from
#         university, home, and mobile networks. Key-based auth only
#         (PasswordAuthentication disabled by Ubuntu default + user_data).
#         Production should restrict to a bastion or VPN CIDR.
AVD-AWS-0107
